flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Initialize Unity Services]
    B --> C[Anonymous Authentication]
    C --> D[Show Main Menu UI]

    D --> E{Player Action}

    E -->|Create Lobby| F[CreateLobbyAsync]
    F --> G[Setup Relay]
    G --> H[Start Heartbeat]
    H --> I[Start Poll Lobby]
    I --> J[OnJoinedLobby Event]

    E -->|Join Lobby| K[JoinLobbyByCode / QuickJoin]
    K --> L[Join Relay]
    L --> H

    I --> M[PollLobbyAsync]
    M --> N{Lobby Exists?}
    N -->|No| O[Kicked / Lobby Deleted]
    O --> P[Shutdown Network]
    P --> Q[Load Lobby Scene]
    Q --> R[Show Main Menu]

    N -->|Yes| S{Player Still In Lobby?}
    S -->|No| O
    S -->|Yes| T[Update currentLobby]
    T --> U[OnUpdatedCurrentLobby]

    U --> V{Host?}
    V -->|Yes| W[Detect Player Join/Leave]
    W --> X[Raise Events]

    X --> Y{Game Started?}
    Y -->|true| Z[Kick Late Joiner]

    E -->|Leave Lobby| AA[LeaveLobbyAsync]
    AA --> AB[Stop Coroutines]
    AB --> AC[OnLeftLobby Event]
